        <title>PUYA ESMC — 外部串行存储器控制器（QSPI Flash 读写）</title>
        <link>https://clingyang.github.io/p/puya-esmc-%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E4%B8%B2%E8%A1%8C%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E5%99%A8%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8qspi-flash-%E8%AF%BB%E5%86%99/</link>
